<p><strong>Provide international opportunities to your students</strong></p>

<p>As the International Association for the Exchange of Students for Technical Experience, we offer educational institutions ways for their students to live international experiences in the technical field, thus enriching their education and preparing them for a globalized working world.</p>

<p><strong>Why become an IAESTE member center?</strong></p>

<p>Professional Internships → Will allow students to apply their theoretical knowledge in real work environments and gain relevant experience in their field of study.</p>

<p>Internationalization → This will promote the development of intercultural skills, adaptability and open-mindedness in your student community.</p>

<p>Global network → The university will become part of a global network of educational institutions and employers committed to international exchange and technical cooperation.</p>

<p><strong>How does IAESTE prepare students?</strong></p>

<p>Relevant experience → IAESTE offers students the opportunity to gain work experience in their field of study, giving them a competitive advantage in the global job market.</p>

<p>Personal development → Living and working in a culturally diverse environment allows students to develop intercultural skills, adaptability, confidence and personal maturity.</p>

<p>International contact → IAESTE is a welcoming and diverse community where students can establish lasting international friendships and expand their professional network.</p>

<p>Safe and quality process → From the application process to the completion of the experience, solid support is provided to students, including advice, guidance and assistance with logistical issues.</p>

<p><strong>I want to participate in IAESTE</strong></p>

<p>Contact the corresponding committee and they will guide you at all times</p>

